    {
      "name": "secrets/terminalValue",
      "x-capability": "host.secret-terminal/1",
      "description": "agents-secret NAME with no session's grant, such as from a terminal (#4179): the value of this machine's secret with Ask before use off, once a person allowed it. A call with no allow opens a Needs you request (secretUse, use terminal) and is held up to 45 seconds on it; while it stays open the answer names it, and the same call again waits on the same request. Approve for 1 Hour is kept in agentsd's memory only. A secret with Ask before use is refused. Any process of this machine's account may call it on daemon.sock: agentsd cannot tell a terminal from an agent that dropped its grant, which the request's words say.",
